—` | Overrides the default DOM element with a custom render function. This allows rendering existing components with built-in styles and behaviors such as router links, animation libraries, and pre-styled components. Requirements: - You must render the expected element type (e.g. if `<button>` is expected, you cannot render an `<a>`). - Only a single root DOM element can be rendered (no fragments). - You must pass through props and ref to the underlying DOM element, merging with your own prop as appropriate. |","table":"table-0"},"1225":{"id":"/cube/inline-select-22","page_id":"/cube/inline-select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/inline-select#属性","content":"| 属性            | 类型    | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                                                         |\n| ------------- | ----- | --- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `selectedKey` | `Key` | 否   | `—` | The currently selected key in the collection (controlled). |","table":"table-0"},"1226":{"id":"/cube/inline-select-23","page_id":"/cube/inline-select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/inline-select#属性","content":"| 属性              | 类型  | 必填  | 默认         | 说明                                               |\n| --------------- | --- | --- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `selectionMode` | `M` | 否   | `'single'` | Whether single or multiple selection is enabled. |","table":"table-0"},"1227":{"id":"/cube/inline-select-24","page_id":"/cube/inline-select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/inline-select#属性","content":"| 属性                    | 类型        | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                                                                                                                      |\n| --------------------- | --------- | --- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `shouldCloseOnSelect` | `boolean` | 否   | `—` | Whether the Select should close